# Nothing generated belongs in a plugin working copy: a dirty tree makes
# `thurbox-cli plugin update` report `kept` and refuse to move. Anything this
# plugin produces goes to $XDG_CACHE_HOME/thurbox-files/ instead.
*.log

# Fetched from the thurbox checkout by CI (and by you, to run selene locally) —
# see selene.toml on why it is not vendored.
/thurbox.yml
# What ci/assemble-interface.sh builds.
/build/
/.thurbox/
/thurbox-cli
/thurbox.tar.gz
